; Under --effective, a balance assertion on a posting with an effective
; date counts only postings whose effective date is on or before it
; (#2071).  The running account total must order postings by the same
; effective dates: the first transaction's posting takes effect in March,
; after the January assertion and before the March one.

2024/01/01=2024/03/01 Effective in March
    Assets:Bank                         $100
    Income:Salary

2024/01/02=2024/01/02 Opening
    Assets:Bank                          $10 = $10
    Equity:Opening

2024/01/03=2024/03/02 After March 1
    Assets:Bank                           $1 = $111
    Income:Interest

test bal Assets --effective
                $111  Assets:Bank
end test

test bal Assets --effective --verify
                $111  Assets:Bank
end test
